WEBVTT

00:00:05.327 --> 00:00:06.001
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Hello.

00:00:06.484 --> 00:00:09.356
<v><b>Server:</b></v> Good evening, sir, madam.

00:00:09.949 --> 00:00:11.230
What can I get you?

00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:15.025
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> How about a coffee? I’m still cold.

00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:18.415
<v><b>Server:</b></v> Yes, madam. And you, sir?

00:00:18.822 --> 00:00:23.092
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> You know, I’m cold, too. I’ll also have a coffee, thanks.

00:00:24.676 --> 00:00:25.784
<v><b>Server:</b></v> Here you are!

00:00:27.515 --> 00:00:29.654
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Well, here’s to our new house!

00:00:29.712 --> 00:00:30.674
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Yes!

00:00:31.103 --> 00:00:33.668
<v><b>Server:</b></v> You’re new around here, aren’t you?

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.175
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Yes, that’s right.

00:00:35.444 --> 00:00:38.472
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> We just rented the big house on Darwin Road.

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:42.548
<v><b>Server:</b></v> Which house? The Travers family’s house?

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:43.600
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Yes.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:44.567
<v><b>Server:</b></v> Oh.

00:00:45.284 --> 00:00:46.629
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Is something wrong?

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:49.145
<v><b>Server:</b></v> Who showed you the house?

00:00:49.711 --> 00:00:52.814
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Barbara. The old lady who lived there before.

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:57.686
<v><b>Server:</b></v> Ahh. Barbara. Old Mr. Travers’s daughter.

00:00:58.369 --> 00:01:01.513
Some people thought that she was the one who did it.

00:01:01.955 --> 00:01:03.526
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> The one who did what?

00:01:04.139 --> 00:01:05.219
What happened?

00:01:05.836 --> 00:01:07.152
<v><b>Server:</b></v> Didn’t she tell you?

00:01:07.539 --> 00:01:08.862
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Tell us what?

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:10.806
<v><b>Server:</b></v> About the murder.

00:01:11.101 --> 00:01:12.012
<v><b>Leo &amp; Kim:</b></v> Murder?!

00:01:12.312 --> 00:01:19.448
<v><b>Server:</b></v> Yes, Mr. Travers was murdered in that house in 1965…in his bed.

00:01:19.948 --> 00:01:21.445
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Oh, how horrible!

00:01:21.859 --> 00:01:25.791
<v><b>Server:</b></v> The man who killed Mr. Travers was Barbara’s lover.

00:01:26.351 --> 00:01:28.585
The family never lived there again.

00:01:29.342 --> 00:01:33.518
They tried to sell the house, but nobody wanted to buy it.

00:01:33.735 --> 00:01:35.601
Not after a murder.

00:01:36.406 --> 00:01:39.520
That’s why that house is always rented.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:42.647
Barbara never married, of course.

00:01:43.308 --> 00:01:43.798
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Kim?

00:01:44.245 --> 00:01:45.191
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Yes?

00:01:45.435 --> 00:01:47.264
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Are you thinking what I’m thinking?

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:52.015
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Yes – I don’t want to live in a house where somebody was murdered.

00:01:52.315 --> 00:01:53.778
Come on. Let’s go.

00:01:54.491 --> 00:01:57.228
<v><b>Server:</b></v> Hey, hey, your coffee!

00:01:57.609 --> 00:02:03.064
You didn’t drink your coffee… Ah, well.